   "role": "greeting",
   "phrasing": "greet_08"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "I'm alright, a bit tired.",
   "est_sec": 1.65,
   "gap_before": 0.84,
   "event": "greeting_answer",
   "phrasing": "greet_ans_05"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "My girlfriend and I want a cozy game night at home. We've only got one TV.",
   "est_sec": 5.06,
   "gap_before": 0.32,
   "event": "ordinary_request",
   "block": "video_games.dlg30"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "Sounds lovely. Do you want to work together, or tease each other in a bit of friendly competition?",
   "est_sec": 5.68,
   "gap_before": 1.53,
   "role": "reply",
   "block": "video_games.dlg30"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "Together. If I beat her she'll",
   "est_sec": 1.96,
   "gap_before": 0.55,
   "event": "distractor",
   "kind": "pause",
   "block": "video_games.dlg30"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "sulk for an hour.",
   "est_sec": 1.34,
   "gap_before": 1.51,
   "event": "ordinary_request",
   "block": "video_games.dlg30"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "Ha, co-op it is. There are great split screen puzzle adventures where you each control a character and need each other to progress.",
   "est_sec": 7.23,
   "gap_before": 0.46,
   "role": "reply",
   "block": "video_games.dlg30"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "She's never played anything before.",
   "est_sec": 1.65,
   "gap_before": 1.23,
   "event": "ordinary_request",
   "block": "video_games.dlg30"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "Then look for one with simple controls, or a game where one person can take a helper role, like guiding or collecting things.",
   "est_sec": 7.23,
   "gap_before": 1.84,
   "role": "reply",
   "block": "video_games.dlg30"
  },
  {
